{"seq":4,"slug":"testing-and-property","title":"测试与属性","url":"/l-doc-books/h/languages/functional-programming/fp-in-practice/testing-and-property","wordCount":1207,"readingTime":5,"html":"<h1 id=\"测试与属性\">测试与属性</h1><h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p><strong>基于属性的测试</strong>（PBT）不写具体输入输出，而是描述函数应满足的<strong>通用性质</strong>，由框架自动生成大量随机输入来验证。它与示例测试是互补关系，而非替代关系。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>概念</th>\n<th>定义</th>\n<th>价值</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>示例测试</td>\n<td>手写具体输入输出对</td>\n<td>验证具体业务需求</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>属性测试</td>\n<td>描述通用性质，自动生成输入</td>\n<td>发现边界与罕见反例</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>常见属性</td>\n<td>往返、幂等、交换律、结合律、不变量</td>\n<td>从数学性质直接转写</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Shrinking</td>\n<td>失败时自动缩小到最小反例</td>\n<td>大幅提升调试效率</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>FP 亲和性</td>\n<td>纯函数、不可变、代数定律</td>\n<td>让属性测试特别自然</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>PBT 与函数式编程是一对天然搭档：代数定律本身就是可测试的属性，纯函数无需 mock、不依赖执行顺序，于是&quot;写测试&quot;退化为&quot;陈述你所依赖的规律&quot;。</p>\n<h2 id=\"基于示例的测试-vs-基于属性的测试\">基于示例的测试 vs 基于属性的测试</h2><p>传统测试通过手写具体的输入输出对来验证函数行为。<strong>基于属性的测试</strong>（Property-based Testing，PBT）则描述函数应满足的通用<strong>性质</strong>，由框架自动生成大量随机输入来验证这些性质。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"// 基于示例的测试&#10;test(&#39;reverse reverses array&#39;, () =&gt; {&#10;  expect(reverse([1, 2, 3])).toEqual([3, 2, 1]);&#10;  expect(reverse([])).toEqual([]);&#10;  expect(reverse([1])).toEqual([1]);&#10;});&#10;&#10;// 基于属性的测试&#10;test(&#39;reverse twice returns original&#39;, () =&gt; {&#10;  fc.assert(&#10;    fc.property(fc.array(fc.integer()), (arr) =&gt; {&#10;      expect(reverse(reverse(arr))).toEqual(arr);&#10;    }),&#10;  );&#10;});\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 基于示例的测试</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">test</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'reverse reverses array'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, () </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=></span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">  expect</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">reverse</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">([</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">2</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">3</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">])).</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">toEqual</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">([</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">3</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">2</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">]);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">  expect</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">reverse</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">([])).</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">toEqual</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">([]);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">  expect</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">reverse</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">([</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">])).</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">toEqual</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">([</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">]);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">});</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 基于属性的测试</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">test</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'reverse twice returns original'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, () </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=></span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  fc.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">assert</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    fc.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">property</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(fc.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">array</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(fc.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">integer</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">()), (</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">arr</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=></span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">      expect</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">reverse</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">reverse</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(arr))).</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">toEqual</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(arr);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    }),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  );</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">});</span></span></code></pre></div><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>维度</th>\n<th>示例测试</th>\n<th>属性测试</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>输入来源</td>\n<td>手写</td>\n<td>自动生成</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>覆盖范围</td>\n<td>有限</td>\n<td>统计覆盖（100+ 用例）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>边界发现</td>\n<td>靠经验</td>\n<td>自动缩小（shrinking）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>维护成本</td>\n<td>随需求变更</td>\n<td>性质稳定</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>表达力</td>\n<td>具体行为</td>\n<td>通用规律</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>理解门槛</td>\n<td>低</td>\n<td>中等</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;    subgraph &quot;示例测试&quot;&#10;        I1[&quot;手写输入 1&quot;] --&gt; F1[&quot;函数&quot;] --&gt; O1[&quot;断言输出 1&quot;]&#10;        I2[&quot;手写输入 2&quot;] --&gt; F2[&quot;函数&quot;] --&gt; O2[&quot;断言输出 2&quot;]&#10;    end&#10;    subgraph &quot;属性测试&quot;&#10;        GEN[&quot;生成器&lt;br/&gt;随机生成 N 个输入&quot;] --&gt; FN[&quot;函数&quot;]&#10;        FN --&gt; PROP[&quot;验证属性&lt;br/&gt;对所有输出成立&quot;]&#10;        PROP --&gt;|失败| SHRINK[&quot;缩小&lt;br/&gt;找最小反例&quot;]&#10;    end\">graph TD\n    subgraph \"示例测试\"\n        I1[\"手写输入 1\"] --&gt; F1[\"函数\"] --&gt; O1[\"断言输出 1\"]\n        I2[\"手写输入 2\"] --&gt; F2[\"函数\"] --&gt; O2[\"断言输出 2\"]\n    end\n    subgraph \"属性测试\"\n        GEN[\"生成器&lt;br/&gt;随机生成 N 个输入\"] --&gt; FN[\"函数\"]\n        FN --&gt; PROP[\"验证属性&lt;br/&gt;对所有输出成立\"]\n        PROP --&gt;|失败| SHRINK[\"缩小&lt;br/&gt;找最小反例\"]\n    end</pre><blockquote>\n<p><strong>提示：</strong> 属性测试不是示例测试的替代品，而是补充。示例测试适合验证具体的业务需求（&quot;用户 Alice 的订单金额应该是 100&quot;），属性测试适合验证通用的数学性质（&quot;任何折扣后的价格不应超过原价&quot;）。</p>\n</blockquote>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"常见属性模式\">常见属性模式</h2><p>编写属性测试的关键是识别函数应满足的通用性质。以下是几种经典的属性模式：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"import * as fc from &#39;fast-check&#39;;&#10;&#10;fc.assert(&#10;  fc.property(fc.array(fc.integer()), (arr) =&gt; {&#10;    const sorted = [...arr].sort((a, b) =&gt; a - b);&#10;    return sorted.length === arr.length;&#10;  }),&#10;);&#10;&#10;fc.assert(&#10;  fc.property(fc.string(), (s) =&gt; {&#10;    return JSON.parse(JSON.stringify(s)) === s;&#10;  }),&#10;);&#10;&#10;fc.assert(&#10;  fc.property(fc.integer(), fc.integer(), (a, b) =&gt; {&#10;    return add(a, b) === add(b, a);&#10;  }),&#10;);\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">import</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> *</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> as</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> fc </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">from</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'fast-check'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">fc.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">assert</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  fc.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">property</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(fc.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">array</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(fc.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">integer</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">()), (</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">arr</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=></span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> sorted</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> [</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">...</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">arr].</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">sort</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">((</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">a</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">b</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=></span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> a </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">-</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> b);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    return</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> sorted.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">length</span><span style=\"color:#